      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "34",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mav'ale mapya ga mawe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', “U'pu'nze mav'ale av'i'li' ga mawe ki'ti' ago ga kwandya, nanne nku'gatona mihayo zyanne i'zyo ndi' zili' ku' mawe genago ga kwandya, ago wagav'elile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wiv'ange igolo ikingilima, wize u'pome nanne ku' nsoto ya lu'gu'lu' lwa Sinai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu' ninga yu'mo ku'du' ize haki'mo nanho, ninga ku'du' egele muntu' ninga yu'mo ku' igu'lya na lu'gu'lu'. Ninga ng'ombe, nkolo na mbu'li ku'du' zidi'mi'le mu ngiligili na lwenu'lo lu'gu'lu'.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene Mose wapu'nzaga mav'ale av'i'li' ga mawe ki'ti' ago ga kwandya. Wawu'kaga ikingilima, na waliinaga ku' lu'gu'lu' lwa Sinai, ku'no adimile genago mav'ale mu makono gakwe, ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wakamulagi'li'zyaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wasookaga mugati' na ilunde, wi'maga haki'mo na Mose, na ku'li'kumalu'sya lina lyakwe, “Gu'ku' Mulungu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' Gu'ku' Mulungu wav'i'taga ha mbele yamwa Mose na ku'tangazya, “Gu'ku' Mulungu, Gu'ku' Mulungu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34:6",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Lina “Gu'ku' Mulungu” ku' Ki'ebulania li'li' lina “Yahweh” ninga “Yehova.”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", ali' Mulungu wa ki'sa na ki'gongo. Akav'ile mubu'hu wa ki'sila ali'vi okalile chelu' na nhana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ene nu'lagi'la chelu' ku' wu'v'yalwa mahu'ya, na ku'v'atondola v'antu' ihu'v'yo, wu'kenagu'zi na wu'tale wav'o, ali'vi nkasye ndeke ku'muv'azi'zya ihu'v'yo muntu' wa musango. Nu'v'asali'kya v'ana na v'izu'ku'lu' wu'kenagu'zi wa v'asav'o na v'agu'ku' v'av'o, ninga wu'v'yalwa wa wu'datu' na wa wu'ne.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe Mose wangu'haga ku'kundamya mutwe na ku'ku'v'i'i'la. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' wayombaga, “Ev'e Gu'ku', u'lu' napandi'kaga wu'soga ha mbele yako, nu'ku'lomba u'ye haki'mo na iswe, ninga i'vi v'antu' v'enav'a v'ali' na myoyo milambu. Ali'vi u'ku'tondole ihu'v'yo na wu'kenagu'zi wiswe, na u'kwanuku'le ku'v'e isaalo lyako ev'e mweni'ki'li'.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mulungu ali'v'ezya ilagano ipya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga ati', “Lingaga, nu'v'ezya ilagano na v'antu' v'ako v'ose. Nku'v'ezya migaka ha mbele yav'o i'zyo zikaali' ku'v'eziwa mu welelo yose, ninga mu ki'la nsi'. V'antu' v'ose av'o mwikalile mugati' nav'o v'alawone mili'mo zyanne mihanya, ku'nguno nku'v'ezya igambo lya ku'kumya ku'nguno yako.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“U'zidime milagi' i'zyo nu'ku'pa walelo. Lingaga, nku'v'asaga ha mbele yako V'aamoli, V'akanaani, V'ahiti, V'apelizi, V'ahivi na V'ayebusi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wiangali'le ku'du' wize u'v'ezye ilagano na v'ikazi v'a nsi' i'yo u'yile, ku'nguno lyeni'lo li'lav'e ki'ti' mutego ku' wako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi u'lagabomole mahozezyo gav'o, na ku'ziv'elanga nhi'ngi' zyav'o zya mawe zya kwisengela, na ku'gaputanga mavimbulimbuli ga miti' gamwa mulungu wav'o Ashela",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34:13",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Lina “Ashela” gwav'age mulungu gwa ki'ki'ma u'go v'agwisengage V'akanaani.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku'du' wize u'mwisenge mulungu yu'ngi', ku'nguno ene lina lyanne ni' ‘Wa Iwu'v'a,’ ni' Mulungu wa iwu'v'a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wiangali'le ku'du' wize u'v'ezye ilagano na v'ikazi v'a nsi' yeni'yo, ku'nguno aho v'alav'e v'ali'zisenga milungu zyav'o zya wu'fi na ku'zifumi'zya vitaambo, v'alaku'kaati'ke nanho u'lalye vitaambo i'vyo v'ali'wisengela milungu zyav'o. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U'lahambagale u'li'v'atozya v'asu'mbana v'ako ku' v'aniki' v'av'o, na v'enav'o v'aniki' aho v'alaye ku'kisenga milungu zyav'o zya wu'fi, v'alav'ahu'mbye v'asu'mbana v'ako ku'zisenga milungu zyav'o.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ku'du' wiv'ezezye milungu zya ku'sula ku' ku'fyatu'la mu ki'seme.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mudime nsiku' zya Mwanya gwa Migate I'zyo Zikatumba. Mulav'e muli'lya migate i'zyo zikatumba mugati' na nsiku' mupungati', ki'ti' i'vyo namulagi'li'zizye. Mulav'ezye vyeni'vyo ku' itungo i'lo li'tu'u'lilwe lya mwezi gwa Abibu, u'go gu'li' hu' mwezi gwa kwandya, ku'nguno mwezi gwenu'go hu' gwene mwafuma ku' nsi' ya Misili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ki'la muv'yalwa wa mbele wa ki'gosya ali' wanne, haki'mo na ki'v'yalwa cha mbele cha ki'gosya cha mitugo zinywe zyose, ki'v'e cha ng'ombe, nkolo ninga mbu'li. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sumbwa ki'v'yalwa cha mbele cha mpunda u'laki'komole ku' ku'li'pa kadi'lana, ali'vi u'yo akaanile ku'ki'komola, alaki'wu'lage lwa ku'ki'vuna nhingo yacho. Hangi' ki'la muv'yalwa wa mbele wa muntu' u'lamukomole. Muntu' ku'du' ize ha mbele yanne ali' makono du'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
