            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ku' itungo lya nsiku' mukaga u'lav'e u'li'tu'mama mili'mo, ali'vi lu'siku' lwa mupungati' u'lav'e u'li'suuha, ninga yi'v'e itungo lya ili'ma ninga lyi'mbu'la.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mulav'ezye Mwanya gwa Mayuma ku' ku'fumya kalu'mbi'lo ka viliwa vya ntomolwa vya ngano, na Mwanya gwa Ku'kuminga ku' ndugo ya mwaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "V'agosya v'ose v'alav'e v'ali'wikuminga kali' kadatu' ku' mwaka ha mbele yanne ene Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu wa Izilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku'nguno ene ndagasage makabi'la gangi' ha mbele yinywe na ku'zigali'nhya mbi'mbi' zinywe. Ku'du'hu' muntu' u'yo alav'e ali'yigomelwa nsi' yinywe ku' itungo i'lo mulav'e muli'ya ku'kanisenga ene Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu winywe, kali' kadatu' ku' ki'la mwaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ku'du' munfumi'zye magazi ga ki'taambo channe haki'mo na mugate u'go gu'tumbile, ninga ki'taambo cha Mwanya gwa Pasaka ku'du' ki'sigali'le mpaka ndiyu'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Hangi' ntomolwa ya ntangi'lo ya nsi' yako u'lav'e u'li'yi'leta mu nnumba yanne, ene Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu wako.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ku'du' wize u'kasev'ye kadi'lana mu mav'eele gamwa nnina.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', “U'tone mihayo zyeni'zi, ku'nguno ku'v'i'ti'la mihayo zyeni'zi nav'ezyaga ilagano nanho, na ku' V'aizilaeli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Itungo lyeni'lo Mose wav'age kwenu'ko ku' lu'gu'lu' haki'mo na Gu'ku' Mulungu nsiku' maku'mi ane, wu'ziku' na lyu'v'a, nawe akalile ki'liwa ninga ku'nywa minzi'. Hangi' wazitonaga mihayo zyeni'zyo zya ilagano, i'zyo nhama iku'mi, ku' mav'ale genago.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ku'kelema kwa wu'syu' wamwa Mose",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yav'aga Mose aho wasookaga ku' lu'gu'lu' lwa Sinai ku'no ali' na mav'ale av'i'li' ga wu'sangi'lwa mu makono gakwe, ndi' akamanyile ku'v'a wu'syu' wakwe wu'li'kelema ku'nguno ya ku'su'nsu'mu'la na Gu'ku' Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene Aloni haki'mo na V'aizilaeli v'ose aho ndi' v'amuwona Mose, kasinaga wu'syu' wakwe wu'li'kelema, haho v'ogohaga ku'mwegela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi Mose wamwitanaga Aloni na v'atongelezi v'a iv'ilingano lya V'aizilaeli, nav'o v'asu'v'aga ku' wakwe, nawe wayombaga nav'o. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho V'aizilaeli v'ose v'amwegelaga, nawe wav'awi'laga milagi' zyose i'zyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'lile ku' lu'gu'lu' lwa Sinai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yav'aga Mose aho wamali'laga ku'yomba nav'o, wikumbi'laga ki'tambala ki'ti' shela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi yav'age ki'ti'le chamwa Mose, ki'la itungo i'lo wav'age ali'ya ku'kasu'nsu'mu'la na Gu'ku' Mulungu mu Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya, waki'siniage ki'tambala cheni'cho mpaka u'lu' wafuma ha ibala. Nawe wav'age u'lu' wafuma wav'awi'lage mihayo zyose i'zyo walagi'li'ziv'agwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho V'aizilaeli v'awu'wonage wu'syu' wakwe wu'li'kelema. Nawe Mose wikumbi'lage hangi' ki'tambala ku' wu'syu' wakwe, mpaka aho wav'age mbe ali'ya ku'kasu'nsu'mu'la na Gu'ku' Mulungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
